        "body": "**KATIE GEE BY DEVOSDEVOSI**\n\n![](https://i.ecency.com/DQmdaoveYon6dM1QXC5U1CzGSmqTsZegCJcQqCznVsymSNF/devosdevosi.katie.gee.2logo.jpg)\n\n\n\nHello and welcome to you if you are new to my blog and posts I hope you are well and find hope you enjoy viewing this latest post of mine. If you are a returning follower of mine welcome back and I also hope you will enjoy this latest offering to the community.\n\nIf you do like what you see please give me a follower and feel free to make a comment in the section below it is always good to have some feedback.\n\nwell lets crack on with this latest set of edits and hope you enjoy this latest post with lots more to follow.......\n\n![](https://i.ecency.com/DQmSybkp5AeupXZtdaawnqrH7XoEF1LgDdeRRF58YMLszZ2/mg5aeqkfcqi6ksuzvh6jjptbjcl6efwx2gvrnpcrhtrkgmtkc5wmfwdrw8ddvqhuarqu3wj4qy8ujedurhlemjjsi3ukjhkd4.png)\n\nThis set of 3 images was taken from the shoot with **Katie Gee** back in February in a studio in Birmingham when we was shooting our valentines shoot and we had some spare time to fire of a few shots in this outfit for a little bit of extra content , hope you enjoy this little set of 3 images . \n\n![](https://i.ecency.com/DQmfKzeX4pJnDpjTva6GjoKbhHzjqnAzxerRHEBi4PQd1nu/devosdevosi.katie.gee.1.logo.jpg)![](https://i.ecency.com/DQmUN5EoQHHAnSZmDCfNY4Aeu8BuxuTSGMdFHdDf1rmr9qM/mxkfdtoswhy1f6xc7insf4gd4njuih2tjnh2d9a7sjegsxpt7ceu4ccztgbsbyjnh6j7g2kgqrtz4onjckxfc7gabnxkpahkhba97osqs.gif)![](https://i.ecency.com/DQmdaoveYon6dM1QXC5U1CzGSmqTsZegCJcQqCznVsymSNF/devosdevosi.katie.gee.2logo.jpg)![](https://i.ecency.com/DQmUN5EoQHHAnSZmDCfNY4Aeu8BuxuTSGMdFHdDf1rmr9qM/mxkfdtoswhy1f6xc7insf4gd4njuih2tjnh2d9a7sjegsxpt7ceu4ccztgbsbyjnh6j7g2kgqrtz4onjckxfc7gabnxkpahkhba97osqs.gif)![](https://i.ecency.com/DQmdX7AsKwuYQh6QXwpBmRmA4dhnWXrvyXgZJ3LH2svR9yv/devosdevosi.katie.gee.4logo.jpg)\n\n![](https://images.ecency.com/DQmdsG3mafUF8jDrxrZsh9qeUDKD2dF1eUieGrwQAsAQu4t/mxkfdtoswhy1f6xc7insf4gd4njuih2tjnh2d9a7sjegsxpt7ceu4ccztgbsbxwu86y2w2kpqn2jierrcqmxbeprvuffnlcpzwagxrdw5.gif)\n\n\n\n![](https://images.ecency.com/DQmSybkp5AeupXZtdaawnqrH7XoEF1LgDdeRRF58YMLszZ2/mg5aeqkfcqi6ksuzvh6jjptbjcl6efwx2gvrnpcrhtrkgmtkc5wmfwdrw8ddvqhuarqu3wj4qy8ujedurhlemjjsi3ukjhkd4.png)\n\n\n\n<div class=\"pull-left\">\nhttps://images.ecency.com/DQmV2R7gYeepMqVTgF5NqJU13RhYhZgdNhZD7R5rxqFCsSC/devosdevosi5.jpg)\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-justify\">\n<b>Spread Positivity and Keep the Vibes Up!</b>\n<p>\n<sub>\nWhat's up Hivers ! Give me a Hive Five\nThanks for dropping by ladies and gents! If you like my blog, I would appreciate it if you upvote and follow me. Also, don't forget to comment and let's have fun in the comments section. See yah next time!\n\n**I am a UK photographer based in London UK. 📸**\n\n\n\nIf you like my photography and posts please remember to upvote and follow me as this really helps with future posts and shoots to keep posting on Hive.\n\n**Hive** needs more photographers shooting models and glamour work.\nSome of my work is **NSFW** 🔞 content but will always have the **NSFW** 🔞 tag on the posts if so required. \n\n**Equipment used for shoots**\n\nNIKON D3x\nSony 4K video\n\nAF-S Nikkor 24/70 1:2:8G ED N\n\nNatural​ light with Nikon sb900 Speedlight​\nRingFlash Godox AR400\n\npost-processing​ Lightroom,​ photoshop, Final cut pro\nMac Mini M4 Pro\n\nIpad pro\nIphone 14 pro max\n\nHuion 22\" pro Drawing tablet \nB&W M1 speakers\nSamsung 49\" ultra wide monitor\nAIYIMA D03 AMP\nREL SUBWOOFER\nApple track pad / black\nApple magic mouse / black\n\nSabrant HDD driver\n\n![devosdevosi.gif](https://images.ecency.com/DQmREDrmHRUh5kWiykhRMfTZ8WnnYv4iPpnSuPQryb36JUj/devosdevosi.gif)\n\nDE🔻OSDE🔻OSI\n\n🔻 CORPORATE\n\n🔻 COMMERCIAL\n\n🔻 EVENTS\n\n🔻 PETS\n\n🔻 PRODUCTS\n\n🔻 DESIGN\n\n🔻 BRANDING\n\n🔻 MODELING\n\nPLEASE FOLLOW MY SOCIAL MEDIA PAGES & MY ECENCY PAGE\n@devosdevosi\n\nLink to all my content and pages\nhttps://myslink.app/devosdevosi\n\n\n\n![devosdevosi.logo.red.larg.jpg](https://images.ecency